      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should also describe configuring the EEPROM device.  We\u0027re now using the upstream zephyr EEPROM driver.  Example \n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/fe3358e6/zephyr/projects/nissa/nivviks_overlay.dts#194\n\nNote that the nodelabel must be \"cbi_eeprom\" to get picked up the cbi_eeprom.c driver.  The write protect signal also must be configured using the \"gpio_cbi_wp\" chosen node.\n\nThis information should be captured as it\u0027s own sub-section.",
